            <div xml:id="d13-a2">

                <pb facs="d13-03" n="3" xml:id="d13-03"/>

                <head>[Tab B]</head>
                <p>Despite press speculations, the President will maintain strictly and scrupulously
                    the secrecy of the Le Duc Tho/Xuan Thuy - Kissinger channel. He expects the DRV Delegation to do the
                    same.</p>
            </div>
